OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the period with a band of
OL,7,Frain arriving through the evening and
OL,8,Fcrossing the region overnight,
OL,9,Fclearing to showers by dawn. Breezy
OL,10,Finitially but winds easing overnight.
OL,11,FFeeling less mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,14,Fscattered showers. Showers likely to
OL,15,Fturn heavy at times with a risk of
OL,16,Fhail and thunder. Light westerly winds
OL,17,Ffreshening through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
