OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FRemaining unsettled through Thursday
OL,7,Fand Friday with further showers which
OL,8,Fmay turn thundery at times. More
OL,9,Fsettled through Saturday with very
OL,10,Fisolated showers. Temperatures just
OL,11,Fbelow to around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
